# Use LF line endings for text files in the repository and in every working
# copy, regardless of each machine's core.autocrlf setting. Prettier (and the
# ESLint prettier rule) expect LF, so CRLF checkouts would fail lint.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
